      "updated": 1794383916074,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is a multi agent travel planner that turns a natural language trip request into a\npractical travel plan with flight suggestions, hotel ideas, day by day itinerary.\n\nWhy this project ?\n\nPlanning a trip usually means jumping between multiple websites, tools and spreadsheets.\nThis project brings that flow into one experience by combining:\n\n- a flight search agent\n- a hotel-research agent\n- an itinerary-planning agent\n- a final response agent\n\nAll coordinated through a LangGraph workflow",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is a multi agent travel planner that turns a natural language trip request into a practical travel plan with flight suggestions, hotel ideas, day by day itinerary.\n\nWhy this project ?\n\nPlanning a trip usually means jumping between multiple websites, tools and spreadsheets.\nThis project brings that flow into one experience by combining:\n\n- a flight search agent\n- a hotel-research agent\n- an itinerary-planning agent\n- a final response agent\n\nAll coordinated through a LangGraph workflow",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
